<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gerrit Jacobus van Niekerk</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Gerrit Jacobus van Niekerk was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boers">Boer</a> leader who served as administrator of the Republic of Stellaland, founded in 1882 with its capital at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vryburg">Vryburg</a>. The republic was formed by Boer volunteers rewarded with land for fighting in a local Tswana and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korana">Korana</a> conflict. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> ended its independence with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/warren-expedition">Warren Expedition</a> of 1885 and annexed it to British Bechuanaland.</p></div>
